i di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=M8ttp1g6OnoQ7kNvwG-zDOO&_nc_oc=Adp9LQxFGaLKyke0DifBteSF0LCsbX90V9aWb4KE6380cwm3khNr8pXXOuWVEcHnZfA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQFDB39mt3rWV0BR5sHryC93qYmcGwxz6XEsVKr895xPQ&oe=6AEE09E3"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XzsEHSFfs44Q7kNvwECDFhK&_nc_oc=AdqR8I9kw83_FvVQrBuO9QMQ9sls5-jEuHJ7f7hHc_rqb1myYBW9us_FEIseAHkD8FQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR4PA7Z8q7QuOCByliSjzcBesAfUGv9W8eRVH31C-45zw&oe=6AEDF5DD"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=drcbhVvJC0sQ7kNvwHhhoSA&_nc_oc=Adrwqm02j8_GczmYAghy63Vk8ZKKxCkA27thgfIM-XkqZy2TdqqjL8HcEpFJ1ZfbnH4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQST_PKZDtkwQpNS8jO_LKJ51ewa86Q4qr8GxZ4xWunGNg&oe=6AEDE44A"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1061729109131103", "im